sequenceDiagram
 participant FD as Front desk
 participant UI as Booking form
 participant S as Server
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 FD->>UI: Choose patient and interval
 UI->>S: Request availability
 S->>DB: Read hours, bookings, and blocks
 DB-->>S: Available slots
 S-->>UI: Start times
 UI-->>FD: Show review
 FD->>UI: Confirm
 UI->>S: Submit booking
 S->>DB: Transaction: insert and audit
 alt Valid interval
 DB-->>S: Commit
 S-->>UI: Confirmation
 else Conflict
 DB-->>S: Reject and roll back
 S-->>UI: Conflict
 end
